specs=[]
specs.append(('t_1830c0ce8353','漆桶不快',sense(
 'a dull lacquer bucket',['the lacquer bucket is not sharp'],['dull black bucket','slow lacquer bucket','lacquer tub insult'],
 'A dull lacquer bucket combines a black, closed container with the judgment “not quick” or “not sharp.” Chan masters use it as a blunt rebuke or answer when someone fails to see, asks after conceptual formulas, or cannot sort the matter placed before him.',
 ['Dahui Zonggao answers a question about the four elements with the phrase.','Sanyi Yu stops an endless patriarchal count, throws down the staff, and calls the addressee a dull lacquer bucket.','Langting Ting gives exactly the same reply to three consecutive conceptual questions from a layman.','Miyun Yuanwu says the unresolved assembly leaves him with no remedy for the dull lacquer bucket.','Wanshou Huisu gives it after an interlocutor admits he does not understand.','Juelang Daosheng contrasts excessive naturalness with the dull lacquer bucket and excessive confusion with a wild fox.'],
 [occurrence('X/X82/X82n1571.xml','漆桶不快','Dahui Zonggao','The complete public exchange assigns this exact four-elements reply to Dahui Zonggao.'),occurrence('J/J27/J27nB189.xml','漆桶不快','Sanyi Yu','Sanyi Yu utters the rebuke after stopping his own numbered list.'),occurrence('J/J33/J33nB294.xml','漆桶不快','Langting Ting','The question-and-answer unit assigns all three repeated replies to Langting Ting.'),occurrence('L/L154/L154n1640.xml','漆桶不快','Miyun Yuanwu','Miyun Yuanwu utters the phrase after inviting the unresolved assembly to respond.'),occurrence('X/X81/X81n1568.xml','漆桶不快','Wanshou Huisu','The named Wanshou Huisu exchange assigns the rebuke after the admission of nonunderstanding.'),occurrence('J/J34/J34nB311.xml','漆桶不快','Juelang Daosheng','Juelang Daosheng utters the lacquer-bucket and wild-fox contrast in his own informal address.'),occurrence('J/J29/J29nB248.xml','漆桶不快','Lingfeng Rendu','Lingfeng Rendu directly tells his questioner that the flower-smile laughs at his dull lacquer bucket.')],
 'One hundred nine exact hits occur in sixty-seven frozen works. Seven witnesses preserve direct answer, repeated answer, rebuke, contrast, and assembly address.','The container image becomes a pointed public diagnosis: closed, black, and unresponsive, it names the person or response that is not quick enough in the encounter.','“Not quick” is an attested judgment, not a separate sense; the corpus does not define the bucket as a mystical darkness or fixed class of person.','Compared 漆桶, 黑漆桶, 野狐作怪, and 快利; compounds and opposite judgments were checked without projecting a second referent.', ['漆桶'])))

specs.append(('t_2165591c2243','鬼窟裏作活計',sense(
 'making a livelihood inside a ghost cave',['working in a ghost cave'],['doing business in a ghost cave','living by ghost-cave work','ghost cave occupation'],
 'Making a livelihood inside a ghost cave pictures sustained business conducted in a dark dwelling of ghosts. Chan masters use it to reject answers and commentaries that settle into mental calculation, blank silence, fixed formulas, or an account that closes rather than answers the living exchange.',
 ['Chengshan Qia says Fu Dashi’s formulation leads people into ghost-cave work, then supplies a contrasting version.','Yishan’s named heir refuses the charge of emptiness by saying he will never do business there.','Yuanwu Keqin contrasts Xuefeng Yicun’s utterance with conscious calculation and ghost-cave work.','Yuanwu later applies the phrase to closing and opening the hand as if that exhausted the case.','Dahui Zonggao explicitly applies it to taking silence and no-speech as final.','Xuansha Shibei tells a hesitant interlocutor that he knew the man was working in the ghost cave.','Baiyu applies the phrase to the inherited goose-and-water image before giving his own night scene.'],
 [occurrence('X/X66/X66n1296.xml','鬼窟裏作活計','Chengshan Qia','The inline attribution to Chengshan Qia governs the exact criticism and his following counter-formula.'),occurrence('X/X82/X82n1571.xml','鬼窟裏作活計','Mingrui','The complete exchange names Mingrui and assigns this first-person refusal to him.'),occurrence('T/T48/T48n2003.xml','鬼窟裏作活計','Yuanwu Keqin','Yuanwu Keqin utters the phrase in his own Blue Cliff prose commentary.'),occurrence('X/X67/X67n1301.xml','鬼窟裏作活計','Yuanwu Keqin','Yuanwu Keqin utters the closing-and-opening criticism in his own case comment.'),occurrence('M/M59/M59n1540.xml','鬼窟裏作活計','Dahui Zonggao','Dahui Zonggao applies the phrase to treating silence as final in his own general address.'),occurrence('X/X80/X80n1568.xml','鬼窟裏作活計','Xuansha Shibei','The complete exchange assigns the exact verdict to Xuansha Shibei after the hesitation.'),occurrence('J/J36/J36nB359.xml','鬼窟裏作活計','Baiyu','Baiyu utters the phrase in his own hall address before supplying the contrasting scene.')],
 'Two hundred twelve exact hits occur in 103 frozen works. Seven independent records preserve criticism of formulation, silence, hesitation, mental calculation, and inherited imagery.','The Zen bend lies in the “livelihood” verb: the cave is not merely visited but made into a settled occupation, and masters level that charge during public adjudication.','The targets of the rebuke vary, so the phrase cannot be reduced to one modern psychological state; its stable fact is sustained work inside the ghost-cave image.','Compared 鬼窟, 黑山下, 意識思量, 無言無說, and 作活計; ordinary cave and longer compounds were separated.', ['鬼窟','作活計'])))

specs.append(('t_e301f6bd33af','棺材裏瞠眼',sense(
 'glaring with open eyes inside a coffin',['eyes wide open in the coffin'],['staring in a coffin','dead but glaring','coffin-eyed stare'],
 'Glaring with open eyes inside a coffin is a reaction that occurs after the person is already enclosed as dead. Chan masters use the image for a shout, display, or attempted recovery that arrives too late to alter the encounter; several immediately add that it is useless or that the falcon has already crossed to Silla.',
 ['Dongta Xi says that even overturning the seat would only be glaring in the coffin and asks what use that has.','Tian’an Sheng answers an interlocutor’s shout with the phrase.','Feiyin Tongrong gives it after a boast of stepping beyond heaven and earth, then says the questioner invites laughter.','Shouchang Benlai applies it after a beaten monk sticks out his tongue.','Shending Yikui answers a shout with the phrase in a cremation question.'],
 [occurrence('X/X66/X66n1297.xml','棺材裏瞠眼','Dongta Xi','The inline attribution to Dongta Xi governs the complete “what use?” comment.'),occurrence('J/J26/J26nB187.xml','棺材裏瞠眼','Tian’an Sheng','The reply frame assigns this exact answer to Tian’an Sheng after the shout.'),occurrence('J/J26/J26nB178.xml','棺材裏瞠眼','Feiyin Tongrong','Feiyin Tongrong utters the phrase in his own exchange after the interlocutor’s boast.'),occurrence('X/X82/X82n1571.xml','棺材裏瞠眼','Shouchang Benlai','The named Shouchang Benlai exchange assigns this verdict after the struck monk shows his tongue.'),occurrence('J/J37/J37nB388.xml','棺材裏瞠眼','Shending Yikui','Shending Yikui utters the phrase after the shouted answer to his cremation question.')],
 'Twenty exact hits occur in eleven frozen works. Five witnesses cover later comment, live answer, bodily reaction, and explicit uselessness.','The coffin makes timing load-bearing: open eyes and vigorous display remain possible as an image, but the actor is already enclosed and the case has passed him by.','The phrase does not prove literal death in each scene; it is a comparison used by the named masters, and its evaluative force is anchored by “what use?” and “already over Silla.”','Compared 開眼, 瞠眼, 死屍, and 鷂子過新羅; longer “coffin eyes” variants were retained as family controls.', ['瞠眼'])))

specs.append(('t_08b3c9809427','死水不藏龍',sense(
 'dead water does not harbor a dragon',['stagnant water holds no dragon'],['no dragon in dead water','dragons avoid stagnant pools','dead pool cannot hide a dragon'],
 'Dead water is stagnant water without the movement in which a dragon can live; it does not harbor a dragon. Chan masters oppose it to living water, breaking waves, clouds, transformation, and movement, and use the saying as both a direct answer and a verdict on remaining fixed in a still condition.',
 ['Baiyun Shouduan answers “what is the patch-robed person’s own affair?” with the phrase, then warns that simply going that way would deceive the questioner.','Hongzhi Zhengjue says deep cloud must change into a leopard and dead water naturally holds no dragon.','Yongjue Yuanxian gives the line as a direct answer to a moonlit-path question.','Juelang Daosheng shouts it at a sick recluse who had not visited Boshan.','Hui Gong’s recorded exchange explicitly asks for the dragon in living water and answers “it raises waves without making breakers.”','Yuanjie Ying asks where the dragon is if dead water cannot hold it and a living-water dragon does not stay.'],
 [occurrence('X/X82/X82n1571.xml','死水不藏龍','Baiyun Shouduan','The Baiyun Shouduan exchange assigns this exact answer and its immediate warning to him.'),occurrence('T/T48/T48n2001.xml','死水不藏龍','Hongzhi Zhengjue','Hongzhi Zhengjue utters the deep-cloud and dead-water line in his own hall address.'),occurrence('X/X72/X72n1437.xml','死水不藏龍','Yongjue Yuanxian','The reply frame assigns this exact answer to Yongjue Yuanxian.'),occurrence('J/J34/J34nB311.xml','死水不藏龍','Juelang Daosheng','Juelang Daosheng explicitly shouts the phrase during his exchange with Zhushan.'),occurrence('J/J35/J35nB336.xml','死水不藏龍','Hui Gong','The complete recorded exchange assigns the dead-water and living-water dragon lines to Hui Gong.'),occurrence('J/J39/J39nB453.xml','死水不藏龍','Yuanjie Ying','Yuanjie Ying poses the dead-water/living-water question directly to his visitor.')],
 'Ninety exact hits occur in sixty-four frozen works. Six independent witnesses preserve answer, warning, contrast, shout, verse, and explicit living-water comparison.','The Zen deployment preserves the ecology of the image: the dragon belongs with moving water and transformation, so stagnant containment is repeatedly challenged in interviews.','The phrase does not authorize mapping “dragon” to a single doctrinal entity; the records establish movement versus stagnation and leave the question active.','Compared 活水龍, 興波不作浪, 澄潭不許蒼龍蟠, and 龍; living-water predicates support the contrast without creating a second sense of this headword.', ['活水龍'])))

specs.append(('t_7af26f7b5de8','龍門點額',sense(
 'forehead-marked at the Dragon Gate',['marked on the forehead at Dragon Gate'],['failed the Dragon Gate leap','dragon gate forehead mark','carp marked at the gate'],
 'Forehead-marked at the Dragon Gate names the fish that reaches the transforming gate but fails its leap and returns marked as a failure. Chan masters apply the image to missed turns in cases, contrast it with bursting through the waves, and sometimes reject a triumphant use of the phrase as a mistaken annotation.',
 ['A linked verse says that after three forehead-markings at Dragon Gate, the fish surges again through the thunderous rapids and emerges from the sea with its eye open.','Feiyin Tongrong’s interlocutor claims that the Dragon Gate forehead mark makes the name known; Feiyin calls this a wrongly placed annotation.','Xueguan Zhiyin says a response to Xuefeng is a Dragon Gate marking that comes too late.','Yongjue Yuanxian says Tai Shouzuo suffered the forehead mark in Dongshan’s case.','Changsha Jingcen says the fish drum must sound beyond the blue sky to avoid people marked at Dragon Gate.'],
 [occurrence('C/C078/C078n1720.xml','龍門點額','Foyin Liaoyuan','The verse sequence attributes the repeated Dragon Gate failure and renewed leap to Foyin Liaoyuan.'),occurrence('J/J26/J26nB178.xml','龍門點額','Feiyin Tongrong','Feiyin Tongrong repeats his interlocutor’s phrase and immediately rejects it as a mistaken annotation.'),occurrence('J/J27/J27nB198.xml','龍門點額','Xueguan Zhiyin','Xueguan Zhiyin composes the exact Dragon Gate line in his own old-case verse.'),occurrence('X/X72/X72n1437.xml','龍門點額','Yongjue Yuanxian','Yongjue Yuanxian applies the phrase in his own comment on Dongshan’s fruit case.'),occurrence('X/X80/X80n1565.xml','龍門點額','Changsha Jingcen','The complete official’s question assigns the Dragon Gate answer to Changsha Jingcen.')],
 'Ten exact hits occur in ten frozen works. Five witnesses preserve renewed attempt, rejection, verse verdict, old-case comment, and a live answer.','The Chan bend retains failure at a transformation gate rather than using “Dragon Gate” as generic grandeur: masters mark missed turns, late responses, and renewed attempts with the fish image.','The corpus witnesses do not supply a detailed administrative marking procedure; the minimal scene is failure at the gate, a marked forehead, and return or renewed surge.','Compared 禹門, 點額, 燒尾, 金鱗透網, and the renewed-wave verse; success and failure images remain distinct terms.', ['金鱗透網'])))

pending=R/'fresh-build/pending-roster.json';pd=json.loads(pending.read_text());known={m['names'][0] for m in json.loads((R.parents[3]/'Assets/Data/master-dates.json').read_text())['masters']};have={x['canonicalName'] for x in pd['candidates']}
for eid,term,s in specs:
 for o in s['Occurrences']:
  n=o['MasterName']
  if n not in known and n not in have:
   pd['candidates'].append({'canonicalName':n,'aliases':[n],'evidence':[{k:o[k] for k in ('RelPath','FromLb','ToLb','Kwic')}],'reviewedBy':'Codex f005 lane A author','reviewReport':'fresh-build/waves/f005-laneA-1213-1222-full-composite.json','status':'awaiting-roster-integration'});have.add(n)
pending.write_text(json.dumps(pd,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
rows=[]
for eid,term,s in specs:
 b=R/'fresh-build/entries'/eid;b.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);draft={'SchemaVersion':1,'Entry':{'Id':eid,'SourceTerm':term,'CorpusBaselineSha256':BASE,'CreatedBy':'Codex f005 lane A author','WrittenUtc':NOW,'Senses':[s]}};wp=b/'evidence.draft.json';wp.write_text(json.dumps(draft,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n');(b/'WORK.md').write_text(work_text(term,s));ep=b/'entry.v2.json';rp=b/'evidence-compile-report.json';q=subprocess.run([sys.executable,str(R/'compile_evidence_draft.py'),str(wp),'--output',str(ep),'--report',str(rp)],text=True,capture_output=True)
 if q.returncode:raise SystemExit(q.stdout+q.stderr)
 rows.append((eid,hashlib.sha256(ep.read_bytes()).hexdigest()))
out=R/'fresh-build/waves/f005-laneA-1218-1222-author-ledger.json';payload={'schemaVersion':1,'wave':'f005','lane':'A','ordinals':[1218,1222],'entries':[{'id':i,'sha256':h} for i,h in rows],'writtenUtc':NOW};tmp=out.with_suffix('.tmp');tmp.write_text(json.dumps(payload,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n');tmp.replace(out);print(json.dumps(payload,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))
